WEBVTT

00:03:27.871 --> 00:03:30.635
Stand up, my friends.

00:03:31.161 --> 00:03:32.193
All right.

00:03:32.193 --> 00:03:35.001
Don't start wrestling yet.

00:03:35.001 --> 00:03:37.781
If you have a free thumb, wave it around,

00:03:37.781 --> 00:03:41.002
make sure it gets connected.

00:03:41.002 --> 00:03:43.694
Okay. We need to do a last-minute thumb check.

00:03:43.694 --> 00:03:47.027
If you have a free thumb,
wave it around to make sure.

00:03:47.027 --> 00:03:48.520
Grab that thumb!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.863
Reach behind you. There you go.

00:03:49.863 --> 00:03:51.421
Any other thumbs?

00:03:51.421 --> 00:03:53.936
Okay, on the count of three, you're going to go.

00:03:53.936 --> 00:03:56.649
Try to keep track. Grab, grab, grab it.

00:03:56.649 --> 00:03:59.179
Okay? One, two, three, go!

00:03:59.179 --> 00:04:03.268
(Laughter)